    {
      "id": "91338525-78cf-5f91-8c73-467aced90dac",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 2,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "{name}의 연습 화면이 꺼지지 않은 채 새벽까지 켜져 있다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "{name}'s practice screen is still on at dawn.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4c2aefa5-9c5a-5d33-92ba-42e5df946331",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "또 막혔어요. 지난번엔 넘었는데, 이번엔 더 높은 것 같아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I'm stuck again. I got past it last time, but this wall feels higher.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bbb98f14-7c67-5e21-9b1b-c6c0fb3c61e8",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "연습량은 그대로인데 손이 안 따라와요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I practice as much as ever, but my hands won't follow.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "84466fd4-bcda-5d1e-b8d3-6c4b181d9cff",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
      "content": "벽이 높아졌다는 건 그만큼 올라왔다는 뜻이야. 이번에도 실전에서 깨 보자.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "A higher wall means you've climbed that far. Let's break it in real matches again.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3528ce34-56ce-5b0a-9dce-edec4d2b852b",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "698c201f-0ab7-5226-a8b2-c60de71159a0",
          "text": "(목표 고르기 — 게임이 목표 셋으로 바꾼다)",
          "sharedValues": {
            "8773fb44-a705-528a-9020-ee053093e9c7": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:698c201f-0ab7-5226-a8b2-c60de71159a0": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "(Goal pick — the game replaces it with three goals)",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3dc2c8cb-3790-512a-99da-802a1629aab6",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "좋아요. 목표가 생기니 좀 보이는 것 같아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay. With a goal, I think I can see the way.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "666ea78a-31f0-58b7-a80a-1edbef3eb39d",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 2140,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "이번에도 넘어 보일게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I'll get past this one too.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4817e32d-0160-5e61-bef9-567544e68abb",
      "type": "End",
      "name": "End",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 2440,
